00:11:18.540 --> 00:11:22.320 position:92%
the highest they've ever climbed in their 133-year history.

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:24.960 position:58%
Today belongs to Forest Green Rovers.

00:11:24.960 --> 00:11:27.851 position:63%
We are going up, I said we are going up.

00:11:27.851 --> 00:11:30.540 position:63%
We are going up, I said we are going up.

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:32.100
Before securing promotion,

00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:33.930
Forest Green estimated they had

00:11:33.930 --> 00:11:37.140
over 100 international fan groups.

00:11:37.140 --> 00:11:38.190
But it's not just down

00:11:38.190 --> 00:11:40.440 position:73%
