00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:44.400 position:83%
We did a media survey recently in the last 12 months.

00:11:44.400 --> 00:11:47.340 position:83%
The global impact of Forest Green Rovers in all forms

00:11:47.340 --> 00:11:49.410 position:66%
of media was 5 billion impressions, right,

00:11:49.410 --> 00:11:51.330 position:66%
and that is as a League Two football club,

00:11:51.330 --> 00:11:54.810 position:58%
so I would say we have a global reach

00:11:54.810 --> 00:11:56.580
and that's a good thing.

00:11:56.580 --> 00:11:58.726 position:83%
In League One, we'll just have a bigger global reach.

00:12:01.560 --> 00:12:03.120
That reach doesn't just elevate

00:12:03.120 --> 00:12:06.240 position:72%
the green message, it's good for business too.

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:08.970 position:66%
More fans generally means more shirt sales

00:12:08.970 --> 00:12:10.773
and more pay-per-view streams,

00:12:11.610 --> 00:12:14.340 position:78%
but crucially, for a small club like Forest Green,

00:12:14.340 --> 00:12:17.220 position:73%
it's the ability to compete in the big leagues,

00:12:17.220 --> 00:12:19.263
and that comes from sponsorship.

00:12:21.180 --> 00:12:24.390 position:89%
Businesses are adopting green things, products, services,

00:12:24.390 --> 00:12:26.730 position:66%
whatever it is, and are looking for places

00:12:26.730 --> 00:12:29.310 position:61%
to advertise themselves and to sponsor,

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:32.400 position:70%
and we find ourselves here as a very visible,

00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:34.110 position:64%
greenest club in the world kind of stuff,

00:12:34.110 --> 00:12:37.230 position:59%
and so we've naturally attracted a lot

00:12:37.230 --> 00:12:38.880 position:61%
of sponsors in the last couple of years

00:12:38.880 --> 00:12:42.063 position:80%
that other clubs at our level won't get, don't get.

00:12:44.460 --> 00:12:46.380 position:67%
Purpose is the most important thing, right,

00:12:46.380 --> 00:12:48.030
as a business or a football club.

00:12:49.170 --> 00:12:51.153
We have to make money to exist,

00:12:52.170 --> 00:12:54.120 position:63%
but we don't exist to make money, right?

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:55.140
It's like the old question,

00:12:55.140 --> 00:12:56.880 position:64%
do you live to eat or do you eat to live?

00:12:56.880 --> 00:12:58.110
We only eat to live.

00:12:58.110 --> 00:12:59.520
If you exist to make money,

00:12:59.520 --> 00:13:02.010 position:78%
then you'll take the hard-nosed business approach,

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:03.450 position:61%
you'll hurt the environment around you,

00:13:03.450 --> 00:13:05.970 position:80%
the people around you, because you're chasing money

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:06.900
above everything else,

00:13:06.900 --> 00:13:09.090 position:77%
so we don't do that, we have a different purpose.

00:13:09.090 --> 00:13:10.860 position:69%
I just don't think, actually, there ever has

00:13:10.860 --> 00:13:13.770 position:63%
to be a conflict between the environment

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:16.920
and economics and ethics, actually.

00:13:16.920 --> 00:13:19.020
I think we can have all three.

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:20.490
With promotion to the third tier

00:13:20.490 --> 00:13:22.050
of English football secured,

00:13:22.050 --> 00:13:25.200 position:73%
Forest Green's journey has entered a new phase.

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:27.900 position:81%
