00:13:31.020 --> 00:13:34.713 position:92%
Eco Park even includes a green tech hub for local business.

00:13:35.670 --> 00:13:38.130 position:56%
Whatever project Dale Vince pursues,

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:40.470 position:61%
there's usually an element of activism,

00:13:40.470 --> 00:13:44.190 position:88%
especially when it comes to tackling the climate crisis.

00:13:44.190 --> 00:13:47.310 position:92%
Back in March, campaigners interrupted Premier League games

00:13:47.310 --> 00:13:49.740
in the Just Stop Oil protests.

00:13:49.740 --> 00:13:52.680 position:72%
It turns out Vince had accidentally funded it.

00:13:52.680 --> 00:13:54.930 line:0%
The need to stop oil transcends sport,

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:58.110 line:0%
it transcends motor race, it transcends everything,

00:13:58.110 --> 00:13:59.182 position:56%
and they reached out and said, look,

00:13:59.182 --> 00:14:00.628
we wanna start a new campaign,

00:14:00.628 --> 00:14:02.670 position:73%
will you help us with a bit of cash, and I did.

00:14:02.670 --> 00:14:04.500 line:0%
What they didn't say to me was that they were planning

00:14:04.500 --> 00:14:08.583 line:0%
to disrupt football matches, which I find amusing.

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:11.790
It's direct action that sets Vince

00:14:11.790 --> 00:14:13.650
and Forest Green Rovers apart.

00:14:13.650 --> 00:14:16.500 position:77%
Removing meats and single use plastics from sale.

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:18.810
Using renewable energy.

00:14:18.810 --> 00:14:21.240 position:70%
Other sports teams, even some of the biggest,

00:14:21.240 --> 00:14:22.710
have been recognized for their work

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:25.020 position:61%
on reducing their environmental impact,

00:14:25.020 --> 00:14:27.240 position:61%
but like plenty of businesses nowadays,

00:14:27.240 --> 00:14:30.330 position:86%
many are accused of trying to assuage any guilt forming

00:14:30.330 --> 00:14:34.380 position:88%
in more eco-conscious fans, and simply not doing enough.

00:14:34.380 --> 00:14:36.330
A portion of every Red Sox ticket

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:37.410
will be contributed

00:14:37.410 --> 00:14:39.300 position:64%
to the Aspiration Planet Protection fund,

00:14:39.300 --> 00:14:44.280 position:89%
which will use carbon credits to offset Fenway emissions.

00:14:44.280 --> 00:14:46.350
Ultimately, Vince has found sport

00:14:46.350 --> 00:14:48.690 position:64%
to be a powerful element of communication

00:14:48.690 --> 00:14:52.440 position:86%
in challenging the status quo of the climate challenge.

00:14:52.440 --> 00:14:53.850
In his own football team,

00:14:53.850 --> 00:14:56.100 position:67%
he doesn't just reach his direct community,

00:14:56.100 --> 00:14:58.560 position:70%
but all those that come into contact with it,

00:14:58.560 --> 00:15:00.573
whether at home or abroad.

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:04.200 position:70%
From supporting the conservation of the ocean

00:15:04.200 --> 00:15:07.050 position:69%
to flying the Palestinian flag on match day,

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:11.310 position:86%
Forest Green Rovers has an identity like no other club,

00:15:11.310 --> 00:15:13.080
something that's hard to come by

00:15:13.080 --> 00:15:15.240
in the world of modern day sport,

00:15:15.240 --> 00:15:19.623 position:92%
